  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Employers pay for accuracy, safe handling and clear records. They judge you by reliability, method and honest reporting.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is writing a clear lab or stock record.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and biotechnology vs pharmacy: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools summarise papers and draft reports. Routine summaries shrink first.
  </p>
  <p>
    Judgment, ethics and accountability hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to read and organise; later, own the decisions.
  </p>

